{"id":"steam-1378241","steam":1378241,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Tarzan VR, Issue #3 - THE DEAD OF NIGHT","summary":"As night draws in, the jungle swamp poses all manner of hidden dangers. Jane is in mortal peril, and only the strange fruit found in the heart of the Valley of Forever can save the life of Tarzan’s true love. Features \"The Strong Bow\" and its flaming arrows of vengeance.","about":"The 3-Part Saga concludes!\r\n\r\n\nThe jungle is calling…so grab your vine and swing into adventure!\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAs night draws in, navigate the dark and treacherous Sulvath Swamps by land, water and air in search of the rare Midnight Lilly and go head-to-head with Tarzan’s ultimate enemy Brutus to restore balance throughout the jungle. Jane is in mortal peril, and only the strange fruit found in the heart of the “Valley of Forever” can save the life of Tarzan’s true love.\r\n\r\nIn this final game of the series, take on vicious creatures – including the dark lair of the Spider Queen – and confront even more brutal enemies lurking around every corner – set against an all-new part of Tarzan’s world.\r\n\r\n\nSwing, leap, shoot, and fight your way through an unforgiving jungle where few men have returned.\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecial Weapon: The Strong Bow (with Vengeance arrows!)\r\n\r\nUnique Jungle Skill: Call of the Wild  (a new and unstoppable animal awaits your command).\r\n\r\nReady for a challenge? Take a deep jungle dive and complete Tarzan’s mission to become king of the jungle!\r\n\r\nWe hope that you enjoy this series as much as we did making it!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378241/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1608415429","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378241/header.jpg?t=1608415429","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378241/header.jpg?t=1608415429","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akama